<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's a frog anyway?!</font>

34
00:02:14,570 --> 00:02:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From which stage do you
call it a frog?!</font>

35
00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:26,930
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Life or Death?!</font>

36
00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:26,930
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Mastering the Move is Life Threatening!</font>

37
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:34,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hold up a hope
on me a bit, would you?!</font>

38
00:02:42,510 --> 00:02:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whew... he collapsed again...</font>

39
00:02:46,270 --> 00:02:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's no surprise...</font>

40
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For three weeks, he's continued
his training on guts alone...</font>

41
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:20,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama.</font>

42
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anko, is it...?</font>

43
00:03:30,690 --> 00:03:33,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, I'm...</font>

44
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Regretting returning alive
from the Forest of Death?</font>

45
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a needless thing because you and
Orochimaru have no connection at all.</font>

46
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:58,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no Shinobi who can compete
against that guy in Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

47
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I was the one to face him...</font>

48
00:04:07,310 --> 00:04:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the Fourth Hokage were still alive...</font>

49
00:04:10,890 --> 00:04:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that.</font>

50
00:04:13,270 --> 00:04:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He already saved this village and died...</font>

51
00:04:18,610 --> 00:04:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a story from 13 years ago.
He's no longer here.</font>

52
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to do something
with our power.</font>

53
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

54
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get some fresh air...</font>

55
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't blame yourself.</font>

56
00:04:58,980 --> 00:05:01,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon, open your eyes already.</font>

57
00:05:05,570 --> 00:05:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's that...?</font>

58
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:11,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be clear, you have no sense.</font>

59
00:05:11,450 --> 00:05:13,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Pervy Sage!</font>

60
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After you've been training for 3 weeks,
you are still this level.</font>

61
00:05:16,330 --> 00:05:18,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you continue like this it's pointless.</font>

62
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:23,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not how it is!
I'm doing this with all my might!</font>

63
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand that, if you really want
to succeed at Summoning Jutsu,</font>

64
00:05:27,890 --> 00:05:30,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you have to do it like you're going
to die or it's no good at all.</font>

65
00:05:31,010 --> 00:05:32,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I'm doing!</font>

66
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:34,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I drill my Chakra every day
like I'm going to die.</font>

67
00:05:34,890 --> 00:05:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you have time to complain about it,
teach me a trick or something!</font>

68
00:05:38,650 --> 00:05:41,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A trick, huh... A trick.</font>

69
00:05:41,570 --> 00:05:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You're going to teach me?</font>

70
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need to risk your life on it.</font>

71
00:05:47,030 --> 00:05:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Life...?</font>

72
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a joke.
Even so, will you do it?</font>

73
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:56,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">O-Of course!
I always risk my life!</font>

74
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

75
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

76
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, follow me.</font>

77
00:06:16,350 --> 00:06:19,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are we doing at a place like this?</font>

78
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:22,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not gonna peek again,
are you?</font>

79
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:29,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that would be nice,
but today it's a bath.</font>

80
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:31,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, we purify our bodies...</font>

81
00:06:32,370 --> 00:06:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

82
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something strange going on...</font>

83
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is such a nice bath.</font>

84
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like heaven... Truly heavenly...</font>

85
00:06:59,270 --> 00:07:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Pervy Sage.</font>

86
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Toad Sage.</font>

87
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:08,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever, but how are taking
a bath and Summoning related?</font>

88
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:13,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, hey, hey...!</font>

89
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?!</font>

90
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto.</font>

91
00:07:18,910 --> 00:07:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

92
00:07:20,710 --> 00:07:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there something you want to eat?</font>

93
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to eat!</font>

94
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:36,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's good! If the training is like this,
I'll do it every day!</font>

95
00:07:36,970 --> 00:07:40,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat up! Because this is the last...</font>

96
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

97
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:45,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, nothing. Anyway, eat!
Eat a lot!</font>

98
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:47,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like there's no looking back!</font>

99
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:54,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what's going on,
but I should eat, right? Okay!</font>

100
00:08:02,710 --> 00:08:04,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seconds! The next one is miso flavor too!</font>

101
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha!</font>

102
00:08:09,670 --> 00:08:10,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more!
Coming right up!</font>

103
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, miso char siu!</font>

104
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

105
00:08:16,350 --> 00:08:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I ate, I ate.</font>

106
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:20,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Pervy Sage...</font>

107
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:24,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

108
00:08:25,230 --> 00:08:26,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for your patronage!</font>

109
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't even get blood from it...</font>

110
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo, are you full?</font>

111
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me, Pervy Sage!</font>

112
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you treating me
with the meal!</font>

113
00:08:46,210 --> 00:08:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! Who said that
I was treating you?!</font>

114
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you a grown-up?! Bastard!</font>

115
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:55,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the by, Naruto,
isn't there a girl that you like?</font>

116
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:57,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

117
00:08:57,180 --> 00:09:00,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I asked if you have a lovely girl?</font>

118
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:04,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... you could say she's there,
you could say I like her...</font>

119
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You could say it's Sakura-chan.</font>

120
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there is?</font>

121
00:09:07,310 --> 00:09:09,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Sakura-chan!</font>

122
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Then go and
hug that girl tight!</font>

123
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:17,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

124
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that a part of the training?</font>

125
00:09:18,950 --> 00:09:21,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, close enough.</font>

126
00:09:21,370 --> 00:09:23,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Right away...</font>

127
00:09:24,250 --> 00:09:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if I do that, Sakura-chan will...</font>

128
00:09:28,330 --> 00:09:33,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! This is training too!
I have to do it or I won't be strong...</font>

129
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if I do that, Sakura-chan will...</font>

130
00:09:36,970 --> 00:09:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a while she won't talk to me...</font>

131
00:09:39,430 --> 00:09:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! If I'm going to master
Summoning Jutsu,</font>

132
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this can't be helped!</font>

133
00:09:44,140 --> 00:09:46,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... Sakura-chan will...</font>

134
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! But...</font>

135
00:09:50,190 --> 00:09:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and go!</font>

136
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want?</font>

137
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:02,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, uh... well...</font>

138
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's money you want,
I won't lend it to you.</font>

139
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:06,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may not look it,
but I'm stingy with money.</font>

140
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it...</font>

141
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

142
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, if I tell her it's for my training,
she's sure to beat me.</font>

143
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there's nothing you want,
then I 'll go home.</font>

144
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait a minute!</font>

145
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:22,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

146
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:28,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is it!
This is my chance!</font>

147
00:10:28,690 --> 00:10:30,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan! I'm sorry!</font>

148
00:10:32,650 --> 00:10:33,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

149
00:10:33,770 --> 00:10:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

150
00:10:40,410 --> 00:10:42,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

151
00:10:43,780 --> 00:10:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow... Ouch...</font>

152
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a part of being young...</font>

153
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, if I do this I'll really get a frog?</font>

154
00:11:02,390 --> 00:11:05,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, that's a definite.</font>

155
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really...?</font>

156
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there anything you've left undone?</font>

157
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

158
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:12,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">None?</font>

159
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about...?</font>

160
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To pull out enormous Chakra
and use it.</font>

161
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:30,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is certain that it is difficult
to have the control to do it...</font>

162
00:11:30,830 --> 00:11:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is also certain that this body
is a vessel too small</font>

163
00:11:34,290 --> 00:11:36,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to absorb the Nine-Tailed Fox Chakra...</font>

164
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's likely that Naruto's body normally
tends to reject</font>

165
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the strength of the Nine-Tailed Fox
in order to avoid too much strain.</font>

166
00:11:45,350 --> 00:11:47,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the excitement of danger and
emotion are the key</font>

167
00:11:47,770 --> 00:11:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to drawing out the
Nine-Tailed Fox's Chakra...</font>

168
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he has to learn physically until
he can automatically use that key.</font>

169
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing personal...
Fourth Hokage!</font>

170
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Where... is this...?</font>

171
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up!</font>

172
00:12:20,170 --> 00:12:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on?!</font>

173
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your training ends here.</font>

174
00:12:24,300 --> 00:12:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? I haven't done anything yet...!</font>

175
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

176
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go die and come back.</font>

177
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die?</font>

178
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:36,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From within the dreadfulness of death,
squeeze out enormous Chakra!</font>

179
00:12:36,730 --> 00:12:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Experience it with your own body,
and grasp the technique of it!</font>

180
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't want to die,
do something about it yourself... Got it?</font>

181
00:12:59,550 --> 00:13:06,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now... we'll see if the strength given
to you is really yours.</font>

182
00:13:12,470 --> 00:13:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I don't grab onto this... I'll die!</font>

183
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

184
00:13:25,070 --> 00:13:26,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible...</font>

185
00:13:27,030 --> 00:13:30,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This rock surface is slippery
from the seepage of the waterfall.</font>

186
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:34,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, falling in that speed
with the control of Chakra that you have,</font>

187
00:13:34,710 --> 00:13:37,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can't cling to the rock.</font>

188
00:13:38,630 --> 00:13:41,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, after this...</font>

189
00:13:41,170 --> 00:13:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can only depend on
the Chakra of the Nine-Tailed Fox.</font>

190
00:13:44,340 --> 00:13:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open up the key...
This time from your side!</font>

191
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:54,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I go on like this!
If I go on like this! I'll seriously die!</font>

192
00:13:57,730 --> 00:13:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

193
00:14:01,570 --> 00:14:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die...</font>

194
00:14:11,330 --> 00:14:14,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today, we'll have
a history lesson outside.</font>

195
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you know, this rock face has
the faces of the Hokage line.</font>

196
00:14:20,630 --> 00:14:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order from the left,
they're lined up from the First,</font>

197
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Second...
the Third... and the Fourth.</font>

198
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So different from the present old man.</font>

199
00:14:35,390 --> 00:14:37,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially the receding hairline...</font>

200
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei! Who's the Fifth?</font>

201
00:14:44,190 --> 00:14:45,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

202
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:48,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that hasn't been decided yet...</font>

203
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps it's your teacher here!</font>

204
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... Weaving an occasional joke
to make for a relaxing lesson, Iruka?</font>

205
00:14:59,330 --> 00:15:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hokage-sama!</font>

206
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:02,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's the Third.</font>

207
00:15:02,250 --> 00:15:04,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Old man!
What did you come to do?</font>

208
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:08,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to see the rock faces too.</font>

209
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:11,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've come at a good time.
Over this way, my lord.</font>

210
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the real man of
the third rock face!</font>

211
00:15:25,190 --> 00:15:26,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage!</font>

212
00:15:27,780 --> 00:15:31,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The third was called the strongest,
a genius,</font>

213
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">called "professor" among
past Hokage!</font>

214
00:15:34,580 --> 00:15:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Huh?!</font>

215
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Iruka, don't say it
in the past tense.</font>

216
00:15:40,580 --> 00:15:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sorry.</font>

217
00:15:41,710 --> 00:15:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you really strong?</font>

218
00:15:43,330 --> 00:15:44,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, you don't look it!</font>

219
00:15:45,130 --> 00:15:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yep! That's right!</font>

220
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:49,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough!</font>

221
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:54,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To take over the name of Hokage
means you're the strongest in this village!</font>

222
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! I'm going to become
the Fifth Hokage!</font>

223
00:15:57,560 --> 00:16:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all I'm really strong,
and handsome too!</font>

224
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't work with
the scores you have now!</font>

225
00:16:07,230 --> 00:16:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a lot of confidence!</font>

226
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:13,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You all are quite young,
unlike me!</font>

227
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:18,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There might be someone who will
take the name of Hokage is in this group.</font>

228
00:16:18,830 --> 00:16:20,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You only have one life!</font>

229
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't choose an impossible road.</font>

230
00:16:23,710 --> 00:16:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter if you live as
you like and die as you like.</font>

231
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

232
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter what route you take,</font>

233
00:16:37,100 --> 00:16:40,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">remember to protect the
people important to you!</font>

234
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:42,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Important people?</font>

235
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:48,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That you acknowledge...
trust and love from your heart.</font>

236
00:16:48,270 --> 00:16:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have people like that?</font>

237
00:16:50,610 --> 00:16:54,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah... Dad and Mom...</font>

238
00:16:54,820 --> 00:16:57,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I hate him a little,
but my big brother too.</font>

239
00:16:57,700 --> 00:17:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...
my dog Gonta...</font>

240
00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:02,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me, it's friends!</font>

241
00:17:03,540 --> 00:17:04,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too!</font>

242
00:17:07,630 --> 00:17:10,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama, you have
people like that too?</font>

243
00:17:10,630 --> 00:17:12,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, of course I do!</font>

244
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really! Who, who?</font>

245
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have my grandchild...
Konohamaru over there and...</font>

246
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of the people in this village!</font>

247
00:17:39,830 --> 00:17:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like you did too, once...</font>

248
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

249
00:18:28,330 --> 00:18:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This feeling... It's that Chakra...</font>

250
00:18:51,730 --> 00:18:52,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

251
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Seal"</b></font>

252
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:07,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It's huge... What is it?</font>

253
00:19:08,830 --> 00:19:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey kid, come closer!</font>

254
00:19:19,550 --> 00:19:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to eat and kill you,
but this gate won't open...</font>

255
00:19:25,430 --> 00:19:28,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bloody spell that seals...</font>

256
00:19:30,060 --> 00:19:31,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're...</font>

257
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Nine-Tailed Fox!</font>

258
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... the red Chakra
was this guy's Chakra.</font>

259
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For you to approach me...</font>

260
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:52,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What business brought you here?</font>

261
00:19:56,340 --> 00:19:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! You stupid fox!</font>

262
00:19:58,670 --> 00:20:04,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you're staying in my body,
as your rent, lend me your Chakra!</font>

263
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:15,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, if you die I die.</font>

264
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:19,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's some impressive courage
for threatening me!</font>

265
00:20:23,610 --> 00:20:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's fine...</font>

266
00:20:24,910 --> 00:20:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a reward for making it this far...
I'll give it to you!</font>

267
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the feeling!</font>

268
00:20:39,590 --> 00:20:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

269
00:20:52,810 --> 00:20:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done.</font>

270
00:20:58,190 --> 00:21:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where am I?!</font>

